# Eastern Plaguelands - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans and formulae whose SOURCE is physically in the
# Eastern Plaguelands, verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Nineteen ship as vendor buys
# off four in-zone vendors (Magnus Frostwake at Light's Hope, the two Argent
# Quartermasters at Chillwind Camp and Light's Hope, Leonard Porter at Light's
# Hope); two ship as drop collects off sole in-zone droppers. Every other
# in-zone-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest records
# carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples
# are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated
# to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Engineering, Cooking and
# Fishing have no Eastern Plaguelands source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/eastern-plaguelands-recipes
title Eastern Plaguelands - Recipes
levels 50-60
zone Eastern Plaguelands
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords eastern plaguelands, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Blacksmithing — Light's Hope (Magnus Frostwake)
  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  vendor 11278 -- Magnus Frostwake (68.12, 77.57)
  buy 8030 "Plans: Ebon Shiv" npc 11278
  buy 12703 "Plans: Storm Gauntlets" npc 11278
  buy 12819 "Plans: Ornate Thorium Handaxe" npc 11278
  buy 12823 "Plans: Huge Thorium Battleaxe" npc 11278
  buy 228313 "Plans: Tempest Gauntlets" npc 11278
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

