step Blacksmithing — Foreman Marcrid's plans (drop)

  zone map 1422

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  goto 49.04,32.73
  collect 12836 "Plans: Frostguard" optional
  note Foreman Marcrid (level 58 rare) is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes the plans in the data.

step Blacksmithing — Scarlet Smith's plans (drop)

  zone map 1422

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  goto 44.36,13.54
  collect 12719 "Plans: Runic Plate Leggings" optional
  note The Scarlet Smith (level 59 rare, Tyr's Hand) is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes the plans in the data.

step Engineering, Cooking, Fishing — no Eastern Plaguelands source
  note No Engineering schematic, Cooking recipe, or Fishing lure has a source physically in the Eastern Plaguelands in the data; trainer-taught staples live in Polestar's own profession guides.
